  "dct:description": "The DSLO v0.8 Scientific Overview summarizes the federated geometry expansion of the DSLO discipline. v0.8 is strictly additive, geometry-only, and inherits exclusively from DSLO v0.7 substrate and manifold lineage. It introduces federated geometry, domain-class geometry, invariant surfaces, mapping surfaces, and registry anchors required for collective thermodynamic geometry.",

